---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
intro: Tell me what you're working on and what's in the way.
description: Get in touch with Laura N. Aguilera Martin about contract and subcontract GIS work, project geospatial lead roles, or a fixed-scope map report.
permalink: /contact/index.html
---

<div class="container section">

  <div class="prose" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-xl)">
    <p class="lede">{{ site.availability }} — contract capacity, project geospatial
    lead, or a fixed-scope map report.</p>
    <p>The most useful first message is a short one: what the project is, what
    decision the maps need to support, and when you need it. If it isn't a fit
    I'll say so quickly.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="visually-hidden">Ways to reach me</h2>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h3>Email</h3>
      <p>The fastest way to reach me.</p>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=GIS%20project%20enquiry">{{ site.email }}</a>
    </div>

    {% if site.linkedin %}
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h3>LinkedIn</h3>
        <p>Background, recommendations, and professional history.</p>
        <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">View profile</a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if site.github %}
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h3>GitHub</h3>
        <p>Code and open project repositories as they are published.</p>
        <a href="{{ site.github }}">{{ site.github | replace("https://github.com/", "@") }}</a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="aside-card" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl)">
    <h2 style="font-size:var(--step-1)">What a fixed-scope map report includes</h2>
    <ul style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:0">
      <li>An agreed set of maps at an agreed price, with the scope written down before work starts.</li>
      <li>The analysis behind the maps, documented well enough to be repeated.</li>
      <li>A short written read of what the maps actually show — and what they don't.</li>
      <li>Source files and data handed over at the end, so nothing is locked to me.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
